OL,3,C'Desperate for answers': Family appeal
OL,4,Cafter death of grandmother
OL,6,FThe family of a grandmother who was
OL,7,Fkilled in her home say they are
OL,8,F"desperate" for answers in an appeal
OL,9,Fmade on what would have been her 69th
OL,10,Fbirthday.
OL,12,FRose Johnston was found with a blunt-
OL,13,Fforce head injury at her home in
OL,14,FDovecot, Liverpool, on 4 October 2025,
OL,15,Fjust after 12.30pm.
OL,17,FDetectives investigating her death
OL,18,Fbelieve there are people with
OL,19,Finformation who have not yet come
OL,20,Fforward.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@KO]
