OL,3,C'Desperate for answers': Family appeal
OL,4,Cafter death of grandmother
OL,6,FA 37-year-old man was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of her murder in May and
OL,8,Fremains on conditional bail.
OL,10,FIn a statement her family appealed
OL,11,Fdirectly to anyone with information to
OL,12,Fcontact police.
OL,14,F"As a family we are still in a state
OL,15,Fof shock and disbelief as to why this
OL,16,Fhas happened to my beautiful mum,"
OL,17,Fthey said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
